      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>In the midst of terrible violence and war in Israel and Gaza, these words came in response to the questions: how to engage meaningfully with Ḥanukkah in 5784 with integrity. How can it still be a source of wisdom and liberation?</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
